Subject: [PATCH] warp: put storage class first in v3 CCIF tables

The MT7988 WARP v3 build enables -Werror and diagnoses the storage class
after a type qualifier as an old-style declaration. Put static first,
without changing either table's type, contents or linkage.

--- a/regs/reg_v3/warp_hw_ccif.c
+++ b/regs/reg_v3/warp_hw_ccif.c
@@ -79,1 +79,1 @@
-const static u32 ccif_dummy_table[] = {
+static const u32 ccif_dummy_table[] = {
@@ -90,1 +90,1 @@
-const static u32 ccif_shadow_table[] = {
+static const u32 ccif_shadow_table[] = {
